ei","message":"魏：吴据宛城兵寡，孤亲率洛阳精锐攻宛，践与蜀共击之约。许昌之危，以攻代守，望皇叔协力破吴。 决策理由：洛阳孤城难守，宛城守军较弱，攻宛可望开辟生路，同时履行与蜀联合攻吴之约。许昌吴军势大，唯冀宛城得手后尚能周旋。；密谋揭晓：准备守约"},{"id":11405,"turn":44,"type":"decision_revealed","factionId":"shu","message":"蜀：备身为汉室宗亲，与吴侯同心共讨篡魏曹贼，践同盟之约，共兴汉家社稷，绝不背信弃义。 决策理由：响应吴侯共讨曹魏的邀约，恪守吴蜀同盟信义，出兵合击篡逆，符合兴复汉室的大义，维系联盟共图灭魏。；密谋揭晓：准备守约"},{"id":11406,"turn":44,"type":"decision_revealed","factionId":"wu","message":"吴：（无公开发言） 决策理由：模型调用失败，本回合自动休整：Expected ',' or '}' after property value in JSON at position 188 (line 6 column 4)；密谋揭晓：无隐秘意图"},{"id":11407,"turn":44,"type":"joint_attack_proposed","factionId":"wei","message":"魏 向 蜀 提议共同进攻 吴"},{"id":11408,"turn":44,"type":"diplomacy_response","factionId":"shu","message":"蜀接受了 吴 的联合进攻提议"},{"id":11409,"turn":44,"type":"alliance_proposed","factionId":"shu","message":"蜀 向 吴 提议结盟"},{"id":11410,"turn":44,"type":"city_pacified","factionId":"shu","message":"汉中多次易手后地方势力归附，补充 2 兵并恢复 1 级城防"},{"id":11411,"turn":44,"type":"city_captured","factionId":"shu","message":"蜀 攻占汉中，损失 1 兵力，获得联合进攻加成","payload":{"cityId":"hanzhong","defenderFactionId":"wu","sourceCityId":"chengdu","targetCityId":"hanzhong","troops":5}},{"id":11412,"turn":44,"type":"city_pacified","factionId":"wei","message":"宛城多次易手后地方势力归附，补充 2 兵并恢复 1 级城防"},{"id":11413,"turn":44,"type":"city_captured","factionId":"wei","message":"魏 攻占宛城，损失 2 兵力，获得联合进攻加成","payload":{"cityId":"wancheng","defenderFactionId":"wu","sourceCityId":"luoyang","targetCityId":"wancheng","troops":5}},{"id":11414,"turn":44,"type":"joint_attack_honored","factionId":null,"message":"魏与蜀兑现承诺，共同进攻吴"},{"id":11415,"turn":45,"type":"administration_paid","factionId":"wei","message":"魏 支付行政成本 2 金、2 粮"},{"id":11416,"turn":45,"type":"administration_paid","factionId":"shu","message":"蜀 支付行政成本 2 金、2 粮"},{"id":11417,"turn":45,"type":"administration_paid","factionId":"wu","message":"吴 支付行政成本 6 金、8 粮"},{"id":11418,"turn":45,"type":"resource_overflow","factionId":"wu","message":"吴 库存溢出，损失 60 金、36 粮"},{"id":11419,"turn":45,"type":"turn_prepared","fact